        "superseded_decided_by": "judge",
        "superseded_justification": "Judge accepted COMPLETED_WITH_DIVERGENCE: 204 charttime differing_conflict rows (0.0061%), all candidate +1 hour, are intrinsic DST-gap transformation loss. mimic-fhir/sql/fhir_observation_labevents.sql:15 casts naive labevents.charttime through TIMESTAMPTZ and :121 writes Observation.effectiveDateTime; mimic-fhir/sql/fhir_specimen_lab.sql:9,18,58 repeats the loss. Observation.issued is storetime at fhir_observation_labevents.sql:16,122 and identifiers carry labevent_id at :12,62,95-98; no FHIR path preserves original charttime, so the oracle value is unrecoverable. Candidate otherwise reproduces 3,362,299/3,362,503 rows identically with schema and row count matching.",
